a tab of splits

A terminal tab split in two, side by side. in tmux a tab is one pane,
parked in a window of its own when out of sight
(`studio/2-term/09-park.go`), and in gio's window one program: a tab of
splits would park a window's panes together and swap them as one, and
the window would lay a tab out as it lays the frame out.
